 "notes": [
  "The Start section (Imperial Occupation, Yavin 4, Forest, The Signal, Imperial Decree) repeats cards that are also in the lists below; only the Objective is counted from it. Qty 61 as published: the section lines give 11 starships/vehicles, 12 Effects and 10 Interrupts against headers of 10, 13 and 9 (headers 59 plus the Objective = 60); dested as listed.",
  "Posted starting 'The Signal' (a Light Interrupt) on this Dark list read as its Dark counterpart Twi'lek Advisor, one of the two listed under Interrupts; it fetches the starting Imperial Decree.",
  "Come Here You Big Coward, Oppressive Enforcement and Resistance are the Special Edition / Jabba's Palace Effects (no Defensive Shields in 1999). 'Dr. Evezan' dested Dr. Evazan; 'Lieutenant Cabbal' Lieutenant Cabbel; 'Darth Vader with LS' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser.",
  "The strategy mentions a planned next version with more ability-2 Imperials; not applied."
